msgstr "Wax tarjuman ah oo la helay ma jiraan. Daabac luqad oo tarjumontu waxay ka bilaabanaysaa gadaal (background)."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:559
msgid "These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console."
msgstr "Ciwaanradani waa kuwo toos ah. Fur midkood in kasta oo aad hubiso, oo u gudbi tusmada khariidadda goobta Google Search Console."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:580
